        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>驾驶员决不能使用。</choice_text>
          <commentary>운전자에게는 사용하지 않도록 권고할 뿐이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>10岁儿童每次最多吃2片。</choice_text>
          <commentary>10세 아동은 1회 1정이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>20岁青年一天最多服用4片。</choice_text>
          <commentary>하루 최대 4정이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
